\f1\fs22 Or in the case of Fridge Force, shaping the future.\
As so it came, in teh very early days of Fridge Force, that they looked upon a bible, and inspired thus-with for their newly ordained Stasis Weapons Division.\
And the shareholders rejoiced, for they had demanded that there be diversity in the activities of the firm. They saw how stasis technology was used to preserve things, and proclaimed that the balance sheet should show equal profit from destroying shit up till the end of days.\
As it turned out, those shareholders got exactly what they asked for.\
